<title>CHINA: ALCO HOLDINGS YEARLY NET DOWN 61.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>ALCO HOLDINGS YEARLY NET DOWN 61.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.0     vs 28.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.1	vs 6.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    47.04    vs 121.67</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,558.55 vs 3,113.96</p>
<p>    Company name		 Alco Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Alco Holdings is a consumer electronics manufacturer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 4.9 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.8 cents) vs 11 cents</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
